Package: nedit-qtify
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: nedit
Conflicts: nedit
Replaces: nedit
Description: NEdit, the classic Motif programmer's editor, built on Qt
 NEdit 5.7 built from its unmodified Motif source against Motif on Qt:
 it runs as a Qt application (X11 or Wayland) without libXm, libXt or
 libX11. Syntax highlighting, tabs, macros, shell commands and the
 nedit-nc client are included.
